calc(75,r'g(x)=\int_a^x f(t)\,dt,\quad h<0;\quad m=\min_{[x+h,x]}f,\quad M=\max_{[x+h,x]}f','기본정리 증명의 차분몫 부등식이 음의 증분에서도 성립함을 증명하라.','Justify the difference-quotient bound in the FTC proof for a negative increment.',[r'm(-h)\le\int_{x+h}^x f(t)\,dt\le M(-h)',r'\frac{g(x+h)-g(x)}h=\frac{-\int_{x+h}^x f(t)\,dt}{h}=\frac1{-h}\int_{x+h}^x f(t)\,dt',r'-h>0\Rightarrow m\le\frac{g(x+h)-g(x)}h\le M'],r'm\le\frac{g(x+h)-g(x)}h\le M')
